    "text": "Suppose that $f(x)$ is a differentiable function such that $f^{\\prime}(x)$ is continuous, $f^{\\prime}(0)=1$ and $f^{\\prime \\prime}(0)$ does not exist. Let $g(x)=x f^{\\prime}(x) .$ Then,",
